  {
   "id": "-5XaQ1O6iJkJ",
   "from": "Matthew Krachey",
   "author": "057bfe4d4b636b43",
   "date": "2012-04-18T17:52:34Z",
   "subject": "Re: [unmarked] Re: fitList functionality",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Thanks Dan,<div><br></div><div>I think I got it. I wasn&#39;t aware of the @Full option on the modSel object, I think that makes the difference. I will have to think about how my subsetting impacts the scaling of the AIC weights, so I may have to make a minor change.</div><div><br></div><div>Here&#39;s what I got:</div><div><div><br></div><div>require(unmarked);require(stringr)</div><div><div>modKira=modSel(fitKira)</div><div><br></div><div>## Grab the good models</div><div>good.models = lapply(as.list(modKira@Full$model[which(modKira@Full$cumltvWt&lt;=0.955)]),get)</div><div>fitKira95 = fitList(fits=good.models)</div><div>modKira95 = modSel(fitKira95)</div><div><br></div><div># Grab the model weights, coefficients for each model</div><div>weights = modKira95@Full$cumltvWt</div><div>coefKira = coef(modKira95)</div><div>coefKira[<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792452951079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1TUU5cjfCZQN7wwO6jIvfN\">is.na</a>(coefKira)]=0</div><div>coefKira=coefKira[str_detect(names(coefKira),&quot;psi&quot;)] ## Drop the detection parameters</div><div><br></div><div># Derive the model averaged coefficients</div><div>coefmaKira=apply(coefKira*weights,2,sum) # Victory</div></div></div><div><br></div><div>It should be super easy to make this into a function. Many thanks again! I suppose I need to dig a little more into the internals.</div><div><br></div><div>Matthew</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div><div>On Apr 18, 2012, at 12:19 PM, Dan Linden wrote:</div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:16px;line-height:19px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:12pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-family:Arial;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:16px;line-height:19px;text-align:-webkit-left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:12pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"color:blue\">poor.models &lt;- </span><span style=\"color:blue\">modSel.object@Full$model[</span><span style=\"color:blue\">which(modSel.object@Full$cumltvWt&gt;0.95),]</span><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-family:Arial;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:16px;line-height:19px;text-align:-webkit-left;white-space:pre-wrap\"></span></span><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-family:Arial;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:16px;line-height:19px;text-align:-webkit-left;white-space:pre-wrap\"></span></span><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-family:Arial;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:16px;line-height:19px;text-align:-webkit-left;white-space:pre-wrap\"></span></span></pre></span></span></pre></span><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-family:Arial;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:16px;line-height:19px;text-align:-webkit-left;white-space:pre-wrap\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:12pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"color:blue\">modelList.object@fits[poor.models</span><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-family:Arial;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:16px;line-height:19px;text-align:-webkit-left;white-space:pre-wrap\"></span></span><span style=\"color:blue\">]&lt;-NULL</span></pre></span></span></blockquote></div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
